===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|medicine|lang=en}} A small [[tube]] inserted into a [[body]] [[cavity]] to remove [[fluid]], create an [[opening]], [[distend]] a [[passageway]] or [[administer]] a [[drug]]

